# Vendor/manufacturer documentation kept locally for personal reference.
# These are copyrighted third-party materials (equipment manuals, datasheets)
# — never commit or push them to this public repository. Case studies under
# work/ should cite such documents by title/URL, not include the files.
work/**/*.pdf
work/**/*.PDF

# The Npcap source tree (external/npcap188/, upstream github.com/nmap/npcap
# v1.88). Npcap is **source-available, not open source**: its EULA
# (c) 2013-2025 Nmap Software LLC grants no redistribution right. Committing
# the tree into this MIT-licensed repository would be unlicensed
# redistribution AND would falsely imply those files are MIT — so it is
# ignored rather than merely left untracked, because untracked survives
# exactly until someone types `git add external/`.
#
# It is present locally as a *reference* only: Ti64Dink calls the installed
# wpcap.dll through P/Invoke declarations written here from the public
# libpcap API, and contains no Npcap-derived code. Nothing in `os/` touches
# it. Unlike the trees in external/README.md it is not a submodule, because
# the local copy is extracted files rather than a clone and carries no commit
# to pin; the version is recorded in external/README.md instead.
external/npcap188/

# Common editor/OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Rust build output (os/ is the Cargo workspace root)
os/target/
**/target/

# Throwaway QEMU serial captures from local fixture debugging. Real evidence
# belongs in a Report under goals/reports/, quoted verbatim — not as a loose
# log file whose provenance nobody can reconstruct later.
os/tmp*.log

# Claude Code local runtime state. Shared settings (.claude/settings.json) are
# deliberately NOT ignored, so they can be committed if the project adopts any.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# .NET build output for the work/tools/ C# host-tool fleet (sdprep is the
# pattern) — sources and project files are committed, binaries are rebuilt
# with `dotnet build -c Release` per tool.
work/tools/**/bin/
work/tools/**/obj/
work/tools/**/out/
work/tools/**/smoketest/
